# Source documents — no PDF is tracked in this repository.
# The original ATS profile documents are archived outside the workspace.
# Provenance is retained in context/assets/inventory.json and the extracted
# assets under context/assets/. See project/SOURCE-CONTROL-POLICY.md.
*.pdf

# Raw company photograph source set (86 originals). The 21 curated, deployable
# photographs live in apps/web/public/media/company/ and are tracked.
compan images/

# Diagnostic capture screenshots. measurements.json in each folder is kept.
project/visual-checks/company-media/*.png
project/visual-checks/static-site/*.png

# Agent instruction files regenerated by tooling
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
